  "details": "Forcing blink to be one parameter doesn't make sense from a creator perspective. It disallows unique blink animations per eye, and breaks compatibility with anything exported with CATS, making 99% of models more difficult to work with. The better solution would be to allow for a single blink animation OR a blink_left and blink_right animation, giving users a choice.",
